=== CONCLUSION (after 3 attempts) ===
3 independent live attempts across roughly 38 minutes (08:20, 08:24-08:25,
08:56-08:57), all resulted in 100% HTTP 429 across all 5 domains, every
single time. Total real HTTP attempts across all 3 runs: 60 (5 domains x 4
