No further retries were attempted after attempt 3 - three consecutive
identical failures spanning over half an hour rules out a short transient
burst limit, and further blind retries would only spend more (possibly
billed) requests without new diagnostic information. Resolving this
requires either contacting OpenWeb Ninja support directly or checking the
dashboard for a rate-limit-specific status (separate from the general
"quota remaining" figure already checked before this session).
